# The local `[patch."https://github.com/youknowone/pyre"]` override documented
# in Cargo.toml. It names paths that exist on one machine, so committing it
# would redirect every other checkout — CI's included — at a directory that is
# not there.
.cargo/
# scripts/jitstats.py's ledger: machine-local timings, appended on every run,
# and four worktrees of this repo would conflict on it every time.
bench/history.jsonl
__pycache__/
